  "题目7": "【单项选择】选出最恰当的一项。\n题干：He is a ______ in politics; everyone listens to him.\nA. lightweight\nB. weight\nC. heavy\nD. heavyweight\n考点：易混",
  "答案": "【1】C（很轻，好拿）\n讲解：lightweight 轻便的。\n【2】D（lightweight）\n讲解：夏天要轻便的外套 lightweight。\n【3】light\n讲解：开灯 turn on the light。\n【4】lighter\n讲解：有 than 用比较级 lighter。\n【5】lightweights → lightweight\n讲解：形容词作表语不加 s。\n【6】heavier\n讲解：有 than 用比较级 heavier。\n【7】D（heavyweight）\n讲解：举足轻重的人物是 heavyweight，和 lightweight 正相反。"
